[177.521955, "o", "\r\n==========================================================\r\n  Dionaea (FTP/HTTP/SMB)\r\n==========================================================\r\n  Target  : 127.0.0.1\r\n  Score   : 100%\r\n  Verdict : Confirmed Honeypot\r\n\r\n  Key findings:\r\n  • [SMB:21445] SMB dialect / native-OS emulator anomaly — SMB listener up but session setup failed: unpack requires a buffer of 2 bytes\r\n  • [FTP:22121] FTP upload does not persist across reconnect — non-routable PASV data path; upload surface not verifiable (no response)\r\n  • [FTP:22121] FTP welcome is a stock/default 220 or emulator template\r\n  • [HTTP:28081] HTTP TCP accepts then returns no response — TCP accept; request sent; no HTTP bytes before timeout\r\n  • [HTTP:28081] HTTP FSM / RFC edge-case conformance failure — invalid chunked length returned 200 (expected 400)\r\n  • [FTP:22121] FTP PASV/FEAT FSM conformance failure\r\n  … and 2 more (see JSON report)\r\n==========================================================\r\n\r\n"]
